# TEMPLATE CONFIGURATION (v1.2)

> **Template-First Reference** — Email structure, section specs, team roster, inference policy, days calculation for the lean 3-phase WSR composition workflow. v1.2 removed scripts the LLM does natively (parser, plain-text builder, metrics inference, gap reporter, 5 trivial validators).

