## TEMPLATE & RESOURCE LOCATION

```
r-genie/WSR_Email_Composer_Agent/
├── templates/
│   ├── wsr-email-template.html        # Parser-ready HTML skeleton (Gmail-compatible) — THE deliverable
│   ├── wsr-email-template.txt         # Plain-text skeleton (structural reference for INLINE chat preview)
