## PRE-COMPOSITION CHECKLIST (MANDATORY)

Before generating ANY WSR email content:

- [ ] `templates/wsr-section-specs.yaml` read (section order, inference policy, days/metrics rules, 4-file bundle)
- [ ] `templates/wsr-email-template.html` read (HTML structure + inline styles)
- [ ] `templates/wsr-email-template.txt` read (plain-text layout — used for INLINE chat preview)
- [ ] `templates/team-roster.yaml` read (active team members for `days_calculator`)
- [ ] `examples/reference_wsr_heineken.eml` available (fallback style anchor)
- [ ] Today's date captured via `date "+%d-%b-%y"` (auto-injection — never ask user)
- [ ] Output directory planned: `project/output_wsr/{YYYY-MM-DD-HHmm}_{project-slug}/`

**If ANY check fails → DO NOT PROCEED → Fix first**

